    }
  ],
  "evidence_gaps": [
    "No direct oral bioavailability, absorption, permeability, or solubility measurement for the query molecule itself is present in the visible cards.",
    "L4 records are for unrelated reference molecules and formulations; no query-matched intestinal absorption or solubility data are available.",
